# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The node of frame p2 (index p3): `emitNode`. First the cases that bind a node without code: an
# induction variable, the carried element, a read of scalar state in locals, a chain node's
# words; then an aliasing set/put (one store), a fold/loop, and the ops by number.
fn wxnode u32x128x512 u32 u32 u32 u32x128x45 u32x128x132 u32x128x512 u32x128x24 u32x384x65 u32x128x65 u32x128x65 u32x128x200 u32x128x16 -> u32x128x512
g0 call wxfg p0 p2 2
g add g0 p3
fi call wxfg p0 p2 0
fpt call wxfw p4 fi 2
op call wxnw p5 g 1
na call wxnw p5 g 2
fa call wxnw p5 g 3
ce call wxnw p5 g 4
pr call wxnw p5 g 5
